# Tests — we DO ship tests/ into the image so preflight.sh and CI can
# run them inside the container. The footprint is small (a few hundred
# KB of .py) and operators rely on `docker compose exec trading-bot
# pytest tests/unit/...` for fast validation. Re-exclude only the
# heavyweight test fixtures / data if needed.

